    "text": "<math> <mrow> <munder> <mrow> <munder> <mrow> <msub> <mi>B</mi> <mn>1</mn> </msub> </mrow> <mo>︸</mo> </munder> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>10</mn></mrow> </munder> <munder> <mrow> <munder> <mrow> <msub> <mi>B</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mrow> <mo>︸</mo> </munder> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>10</mn></mrow> </munder> <munder> <mrow> <munder> <mrow> <msub> <mi>B</mi> <mn>3</mn> </msub> </mrow> <mo>︸</mo> </munder> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>10</mn></mrow> </munder> <mo>…</mo><mo>…</mo><mn>..</mn><munder> <mrow> <munder> <mrow> <msub> <mi>B</mi> <mn>9</mn> </msub> </mrow> <mo>︸</mo> </munder> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>10</mn></mrow> </munder> </mrow> </math><br /><math><msup><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msup></math> kind of book can be selected in <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> ways.<br />Similarly each kind of book can be selected in <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> ways.<br />So, selection of atleast one book <math><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>…</mo><mo>…</mo><mo>…</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>9&nbsp;</mn><mi></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
